## 创建 Quota

```http
POST /admin/v1/quotas
```

活动总预算：

```bash
curl -X POST http://localhost:8080/admin/v1/quotas \
  -H 'content-type: application/json' \
  -d '{
    "activityId": "act_xxx",
    "quotaType": "BUDGET",
    "scope": "ACTIVITY",
    "scopeKey": "TOTAL",
    "totalValue": "10000.00"
  }'
```

用户参与次数限制：

```bash
curl -X POST http://localhost:8080/admin/v1/quotas \
  -H 'content-type: application/json' \
  -d '{
    "activityId": "act_xxx",
    "quotaType": "USER_LIMIT",
    "scope": "USER",
    "scopeKey": "10001",
    "totalValue": "1"
  }'
```

当前支持的 quota：

```text
BUDGET       活动预算
STOCK        奖品库存，模型已定义，业务流程待扩展
USER_LIMIT   用户次数限制
DAILY_LIMIT  每日次数限制，模型已定义，业务流程待扩展
```

当前支持的 scope：

```text
ACTIVITY
USER
IP
DEVICE
```

## 模拟运行

```http
POST /admin/v1/simulate
```

模拟运行不会写入：

```text
marketing_event_inbox
marketing_participation
marketing_grant_order
marketing_outbox
marketing_quota
```

示例：

```bash
curl -X POST http://localhost:8080/admin/v1/simulate \
  -H 'content-type: application/json' \
  -d '{
    "eventId": "evt_sim_001",
    "eventType": "DEPOSIT_SUCCESS",
    "sourceSystem": "payment",
    "tenantId": "site_001",
    "subject": {"type": "USER", "id": "10001"},
    "biz": {"bizType": "DEPOSIT", "bizId": "pay_sim_001"},
    "occurredAt": "2026-05-24T12:00:00Z",
    "attributes": {
      "amount": "299.00",
      "currency": "CNY",
      "isFirstDeposit": true
    }
  }'
```

输出包含：

```text
命中的 participation 预览
预计 grant_order
预计 outbox reward command
拒绝原因
```

